window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Reese Turmel has sworn off women. Commitment wasn’t something he was willing to consider again after his wife cheated on him while he was on deployment. However, not even a man as jaded as the former SEAL could deny the instant attraction that sizzled to life the first time he walked into Treats Bakery and saw the beautiful woman behind the counter—and he tried.</p> <p>Sadie Pierce has vowed never to trust another man—not since the last one she let into her life cleaned out all of her bank accounts. Now on the verge of losing her bakery, she’s more determined than ever to ignore the man who is a walking, talking, dream come to life. The problem is Reese is of a different mind and refuses to give up.</p> <p>With a deadline looming, Reese ups his game and makes Sadie an offer she can’t refuse. An offer that comes with consequences neither of them was prepared for.</p> <p>Reese might have to commit. Sadie might have to trust. But together, they’ll have to fight for their lives.</p> <p><i>Dangerous Games</i> is the latest romantic suspense thriller from <i>USA Today</i> and<i> Wall Street Journal</i> best-selling author Riley Edwards. New series, new steamy, hot heroes. Welcome to Takeback.</p>"; 
